/godotengine/godot/pull/107305.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-09T17:54:32Z"},"body":"![Peek 2025-06-09 15-15](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fed69526-1dd9-403a-97c0-c17983048501)\r\n\r\nThe cause of the problem is that drawing text with a negative trimming width means disabling clipping & trimming.\r\n\r\nAs you've noticed, the close button can also go outside the window. This PR leaves the close button alone as the proper solution is to limit the window's width. But doing that breaks compatibility.\r\n\r\nAlso documented the information I found when inspecting this issue.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107305/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107305/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}